msgid "Settings"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: directory
#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:124
#, php-format
msgid "Early check is on, but the loader could not be written to %s. The check still runs, just a little later during loading."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:155
msgid "Visitors of protected URLs first solve a small proof of work in their browser: double SHA-256 below a target, like Bitcoin mining. Humans wait about a second once; crawlers that rotate IPs pay that for every single request. No third-party service, no tracking, nothing stored on the server."
msgstr ""

